R6 net11 net12 37.5MEG
C5 net12 GND 0.3p
C6 net11 v_lpf 0.6p
x3 vdd net10 v_lpf v_lpf net12 vss ota-2stage
I3 vdd net13 20u
x4 vdd net13 v_hpf v_hpf net15 vss ota-2stage
